Dear reviewers,

we thank you for taking the time to provide helpful feedback. In the meantime we have been working on implementing your suggestions, and, in particular, we have extended our experiments as follows:
- We increased the number of seeds for all experiments to 10 providing further evidence that our method enables sample-efficient HPO for RL;
- To show the sensibility of the discretization of the search spaces, we additionally compare to PBT on a continuous PPO configuration space for the MuJoCo environments;
- We provide additional plots that show the rewards to complement the existing ranking plots.

Besides these improvements to the experiments, we address your individual comments in individual responses to each review.
